      "message": "As I think about this more, the issue is that the USB_MUX_FLAG_DISCONNECT_LATCH flag is only needed to correct behavior when exiting S3/S0ix.  What about modifying this flag so that it can only be set if the AP is suspended.  For example:\n\n    if (chipset_in_state(CHIPSET_STATE_ANY_SUSPEND))\n        usb_mux_set_disconnect_latch_flag(port, true);\n\nCan you try that out as a separate CL?  The two co-dependent flags is making this code more complicated harder to maintain.",
